  "description": "This package is a wrapper of Oracle Instant Client v23.26.4.0.0 (Basic edition) and the GDAL 3.12.1 Oracle plugins for Windows. The GDAL Oracle plugins in this version import thinkgeo_gdal.dll, so they need ThinkGeo.Gdal.Dependency.Windows 15.1.0-beta004 or later. It is a foundational component for ThinkGeo.Oracle and should not be directly referenced in projects.\n\nIncludes:\n- Oracle Instant Client v23.26.4.0.0 (oci.dll, oraociei.dll, orannz.dll, legacy.dll)\n- GDAL Oracle plugins v3.12.1 (gdal_GEOR.dll for GeoRaster, ogr_OCI.dll for OracleSpatial)\n\nSupported Platforms: Windows x64. Minimum OS: Windows 10 / Windows Server 2016.\n\nNote: The Oracle Instant Client binaries are subject to the Oracle Technology Network License Agreement for Oracle Instant Client (OTN License). The GDAL plugins are X/MIT licensed. See LICENSE.txt and README.md inside the package for details.",
